<title>USA: ICG Communications Q4 loss widens.</title>
<headline>ICG Communications Q4 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    loss		$1.91     loss	 $1.52</p>
<p> Net    loss	     57,805     loss	37,691</p>
<p> Revs			53,105		   31,995</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  30,296		   24,852</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr     loss	     $6.83     loss	 $3.25</p>
<p> Net     loss	   184,107     loss	76,648</p>
<p> Revs		     169,094		  111,610</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  26,955		   23,604</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTES: Fourth quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>The company said it has elected to change its fiscal year-end to December 31, effective 1997.</p>
<p>Full company name is ICG Communications Inc.</p>
